5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let's pick the best spot! I want to make sure the costs are fair for everyone this time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It would be lovely if we could choose a place that brings the different year-groups closer together.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to be practical. I'm concerned about the administrative burden on the organizers.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I just want to make sure we actually get some sleep so we can train hard!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We need a clear picture of the actual expenses before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'll look into the transport receipts and the whole-building let terms.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will check what the seniors say about mixing and the attendance sheets.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I'll investigate the public booking lottery and the canteen closure details.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm going for the inland club accounts and the prefecture rate sheet.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I'll check the membership list against train times and the club hall timetable.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
