30,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Transport is a huge cost, and those whole-building lets sound risky if people cancel.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It seems the evenings are key for bonding, but some people just don't show up to away camps.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Public bookings are a bureaucratic nightmare, and cooking for ourselves is a waste of time.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Public beds are cheap, but those inland clubs had terrible sleeping arrangements.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Our own hall is crowded, and many members can't even get to campus by nine.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mio,,"If we stay local, we save a lot of money on transport.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"But if we stay local, will the students actually bond, or just go home?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,Avoiding the lottery and the cooking duty should be a priority for the staff.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Rin,,I don't want to be eight people to a room with an eleven o'clock curfew.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Misaki,,Staying on campus would require paying for beds for a third of the group anyway.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mio,,"Maybe a private lodge is better, even if the booking is strict?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shizue,,A lodge where everyone stays together would definitely help the year-groups mix.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,As long as we don't have to spend weeks on paperwork or hours in a kitchen.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Rin,,As long as the beds are comfortable and we aren't packed in like sardines.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We must ensure the final cost is predictable and doesn't leave a deficit.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
