55,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A is cheap but messy. B is a lottery. C is a private lodge.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option C sounds wonderful for the social atmosphere and bringing everyone together.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option C avoids the public lottery and the cooking duties of Option A.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option B sounds like a sleep nightmare. I prefer the lodge or campus.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option C has non-refundable deposits, which is a financial risk if people drop out.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mio,,"But Option A's transport savings are great, even if the hall is busy.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"If we want the club to survive, we need the members to feel connected.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,The administrative ease of Option C outweighs the risks for me.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Rin,,I vote for the lodge! I want a real bed and a good night's sleep.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'm still worried about the budget, but Option A's scheduling is a disaster.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'll go with the lodge. It's a new adventure for the club!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. The Coastal Lodge is the best for our community.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'm voting for the lodge to save the organizers' sanity.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Rin,,Definitely the lodge.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"If everyone else is in agreement, I'll support the lodge, provided we're strict with deposits.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
